	(text "SWD headers are parallel; VTref is 3V3. SWO is unused.\nReset: P0.18 / UICR reset enabled; also resets handle mux.\nRev E leaves NFC pins unconnected; no NFC pin setup required.\nRev E frees 14 GPIOs; still use calibrated RC LFCLK, no LFXO.\nP0.29/P0.31/P0.30 = power Gray bits S0/S1/S2. P1.11 = panel IRQ."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 223.52 0)
